  "data_abstract": "BNL-RHIC. Study of K*(892)0 production in heavy ion collisions. The transverse mass distribution from central AU-AU collisions at nucleon-nucleon SQRT(S) = 130 GeV is presented and ratios of K*0 yields to negative hadrons, kaon and phi mesons are derived by combining with previous STAR data.\n",
